0..78 Comment "//! Representation independence of two structures, after Sterling, Gratzer and"
79..153 Comment "//! Birkedal [Sterling-2023-univalent_reference_types], § 5, the counters"
154..236 Comment "//! `posCounter ≡ negCounter` and the structure identity principle in Sterling\'s"
237..290 Comment "//! _Reflexive graph lenses in univalent foundations_"
291..371 Comment "//! [Sterling-2026-reflexive_graph_lenses_univalent_foundations]: a structure is"
372..445 Comment "//! a record over a carrier, its identity is read field by field, and two"
446..526 Comment "//! structures whose carriers are equivalent, the fields carried along, are one."
527..607 Comment "//! The identity of a product is the product of its factors\' identities, and the"
608..684 Comment "//! identity of a dependent pair is a path between the first components and,"
685..721 Comment "//! over it, one between the second."
722..725 Comment "//!"
726..799 Comment "//! - cites: [Sterling-2026-reflexive_graph_lenses_univalent_foundations]"
800..854 Comment "//! - cites: [Sterling-2023-univalent_reference_types]"
